From 0e888eb13b614ca765324b6435fd69beaa8e057a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:52:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mod messages for WASM mods (API block 8)

Capabilities net (server) and net-client (client): bytes between a mod's
halves on <mod id>:<name> channels over the existing horizon:mod_net
payload; net-message hooks both ways; API level 10; net-echo and
net-client-demo examples with harness support.
